      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Clone Your Voice — ZONOS3-Mini\n\n1. **First run:** just press Run. ZONOS3 downloads its voice server and model (about 1.7 GB, once) into `ComfyUI/models/zonos3` and starts by itself. Windows with an NVIDIA GPU.\n2. In **Load Audio**, upload 10–30 seconds of your own voice: one speaker, no music, little background noise.\n3. Type your script in **ZONOS3 Text to Speech** and pick its language.\n4. Press **Run**. The result plays and is saved under `output/audio/ZONOS3`.\n\n**Tips**\n- Same seed = same take. Change the seed for another take.\n- *Voice profile* is steadier; *raw clip* can sound closer to the original.\n- Only clone your own voice, or a voice you have written permission to use."
      ]
    },
